# Moddy Arena: a battle lost. A battle gives him 3 lives. He starts a battle, walks into the first wave without fighting
# back, and the husks knock him out: he has 2 lives left, comes back in the prep room and the battle goes on (the wave's
# monsters are still there, the board still says wave 1); after a count of 3 on his action bar he is back in the arena.
# He is knocked out twice more (the last two by command, to keep the test short); out of lives, and on his own, the battle is lost. He is told in plain words, and the arena is
# tidied: the wave's mobs are gone, and what he dropped is carried to the prep room for him.
@intent a player knocked out with lives left comes back, is taken back into the arena after a count, and the battle goes on; out of lives the battle is lost, he is back in the prep room, and the arena is tidied
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
# something of his own, to show that being knocked out in a battle loses him nothing
give @s minecraft:iron_sword

@step he starts a battle with the button
# a couple of steps toward the gate, then the start button on the control panel
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s

@step wave 1 comes and he is taken in
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
# the gate shut with iron bars as the wave came, and he was taken just inside it; he walks on into the arena
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:iron_bars
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 20t
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=30]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@shot in-the-arena

@step the husks knock him out, and with 2 lives left the battle goes on
# he does not fight back: three husks on Normal take his 20 health in well under a minute
@expect chat Knocked out! 2 lives left within 180s
@expect actionbar 2 lives left. Back into the arena in 3 within 10s
@wait 1s
# he respawns at the arena's home, the prep room, and the wave is still on
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Battle on: wave 1 of 5"}}]
@aim look 180 5
@shot knocked-out-lives-left
# after the count he is taken back into the arena, while the wave is still on
@expect actionbar Back in the arena within 6s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-1,y=63,z=14,dx=3,dy=3,dz=2]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]

@step knocked out again: 1 life left, still on
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 1 life left within 10s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Battle on: wave 1 of 5"}}]

@step out of lives: the battle is lost
kill @s
@expect chat no lives left within 10s
@expect chat ran out of lives or left within 10s
@wait 2s
@shot lost

@step back in the prep room, and the arena is tidied
# he respawns at the arena's home, the prep room
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8]
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,tag=!moddyarena_panel,tag=!moddyarena_champions,x=-17,y=60,z=-17,dx=34,dy=40,dz=34]
# what he dropped when he was knocked out was carried to the prep room, where he stands, and he has it again
@repeat 40 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:iron_sword
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:iron_sword
@aim look 180 12
@wait 1s
@shot back-in-the-prep-room
